{"id":"msg_m_ex_aegis_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_aegis","label":"Aegis · Group"},"label":"3. Attention!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_aegis_02","next":"msg_m_ex_aegis_04","speakers":{"anchor":"Anchor","mast_s":"Mast","helm_s":"Helm"},"icons":{"anchor":"si_c351_00_s","mast_s":"si_c350_01_s","helm_s":"si_c353_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_1","text":"Attention!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_2","text":"Attention, everyone!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_3","text":"Summer has officially arrived,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_4","text":"and that means it's time to go swimming and check out some marine life.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_5","text":"Who wants to go swimming?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_6","text":"I'll go.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_7","text":"Okay, Mast and I make two.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_8","text":"When?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_9","text":"Sometime next week, maybe?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_10","text":"We can put it to a vote.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_11","text":"If possible, let's aim for the weekend.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_12","text":"Sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_13","text":"It'd be hard for us to swing it on a weekday as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_14","text":"How about Saturday?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_15","text":"Don't we have an event on the Admire that day?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_16","text":"Okay, Sunday then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_17","text":"Count me in.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_18","text":"That's three.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_19","text":"Only one more person to make a full house.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_20","text":"I'm looking at you Helm.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_21","text":"I can't.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_22","text":"Why not?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_23","text":"I don't want to wear a swimsuit unless it's absolutely necessary.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_24","text":"Are you that against wearing one?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_25","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_26","text":"Why?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_27","text":"Must I explain everything to you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_28","text":"If you don't want to say it out loud, you could send out a radio signal.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_29","text":"That's not what I mean!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_30","text":"If I'm understanding this situation correctly,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_31","text":"I think Helm is a wee bit embarrassed about donning a swimsuit again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_32","text":"If you're a seasoned seafaring gent, then showing a little skin shouldn't be something that worries you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_33","text":"I'm not a man!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_34","text":"It doesn't matter what gender you are!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_35","text":"The most important thing to a pirate is harboring a scorching passion that burns deep within your heart.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_36","text":"How many times do I have to remind you that we're not pirates? We are members of the navy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_37","text":"I'm a little disappointed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_38","text":"Why's that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_39","text":"I don't want you to feel embarrassed of your body because of a swimsuit, Helm. You're beautiful either way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_40","text":"I'm not refusing outright,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_41","text":"I'm just","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_42","text":"Oooh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_43","text":"So there's still hope yet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_44","text":"What a twist!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_45","text":"So it's not necessarily a hard pass from you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_46","text":"I'm glad to hear that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_47","text":"What about me, Captain?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_48","text":"How do I look?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_49","text":"If you ask me, I think this swimsuit is sexy and sultry,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_50","text":"while also having a bit of pirate flair to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_51","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_51","text":"The pirate logo on the top is quite memorable.","jump":"m_ex_aegis_03_53"},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_52","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_52","text":"It's both cute, yet sophisticated.","jump":"m_ex_aegis_03_53"},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_53","text":"Thanks!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_54","text":"It's always nice to hear a compliment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_55","text":"I knew I wouldn't be the only one who liked it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_56","text":"So,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_57","text":"next Sunday, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_58","text":"Just don't flake on me, Subordinate.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_59","text":"Otherwise, there's no point in me wearing a swimsuit.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_60","text":"No, what I mean is","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_61","text":"since we all promised to go, no one should bow out now...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_03_62","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_03_62","text":"All right, I'll be sure to be there.","jump":null}],"chat":true}